## The one thing this teaches
**A custom order is just a rank.** Once each letter has a rank, you are sorting by a key — and with 26 keys, counting beats comparing.

## Approach
```java
int[] count = new int[26];
boolean[] ranked = new boolean[26];
for (char c : t.toCharArray()) count[c - 'a']++;
