Parities of prefixes: 0 (empty), 1, 0, 1. The odd prefixes at positions 1 and 3 pair with the even ones before them: 1 + 2 = 3 from odd prefixes, plus 1 from the even prefix at position 2 pairing with the odd one at 1: 4.

