Sorted: 2 3 5 7 11 13 17. Positions are revealed in the order 0, 2, 4, 6, 3, 1, 5, so deck[0] = 2, deck[2] = 3, deck[4] = 5, deck[6] = 7, deck[3] = 11, deck[1] = 13, deck[5] = 17.

