## The one thing this teaches
**Compress into runs when the answer only depends on runs.** The positions of individual characters do not matter here — only how long each block of equal characters is and which blocks are neighbours.

## Approach
```java
int prev = 0, cur = 1, count = 0;
for (int i = 1; i < n; i++) {
    if (s.charAt(i) == s.charAt(i - 1)) cur++;
    else { count += Math.min(prev, cur); prev = cur; cur = 1; }
}
count += Math.min(prev, cur);
